<title>FINLAND: Finnair says to cancel cargo fuel surchage May 2.</title>
<headline>Finnair says to cancel cargo fuel surchage May 2.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish airline Finnair said on Monday that it was to cancel its cargo fuel surcharge from May 2.</p>
</text>
